        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=BUExyViTOxeS30CR]], each creature in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can see within 60 feet. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage 8d6 average type=necrotic]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition until the start of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s next turn. While Poisoned, the target can't regain Hit Points. <em>Success:</em> Half damage only.</p>",
